GO and KEGG GSEA were omitted: GO preranked analysis exceeded the execution budget and KEGG requires repeated online annotation retrieval. The cached, focused Hallmark subset was analyzed instead.
Used cached, project-local Hallmark gene sets for these themes: Epithelial Mesenchymal Transition; TGF-beta Signaling; Inflammatory Response; IL-6/JAK/STAT3 Signaling; TNF-alpha Signaling via NF-kB; Angiogenesis; Hypoxia
High/low is an exploratory median split in the same discovery cohort; results are not independent validation.
A fresh msigdbr download was not performed; msigdbr is not installed. Signature scores are mean within-cohort z-scores, not GSVA/ssGSEA.
